{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://wulouniu.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"reign of Augustus (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Reign_of_Augustus\" title=\"Reign of Augustus\">reign of Augustus</a></b> <i>(bust pictured)</i> relied on chance, experimentation and improvisation, according to one historian?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reign_of_Augustus","retrieved":1775889381790},{"title":"Walla Walla River (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that in 1936 the Supreme Court ruled that Oregon could divert all of its own water in the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Walla_Walla_River\" title=\"Walla Walla River\">Walla Walla River</a></b> from Washington?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walla_Walla_River","retrieved":1775889381790},{"title":"Sam Jaffe (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Sam_Jaffe_(naturalist)\" title=\"Sam Jaffe (naturalist)\">Sam Jaffe</a></b> brought \"wine, cheese and live caterpillars\" to gallery openings of his photographs?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sam_Jaffe_(naturalist)","retrieved":1775889381792},{"title":"Big Mama (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <a href=\"/wiki/Flying_Lotus\" title=\"Flying Lotus\">Flying Lotus</a> created <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Big_Mama_(EP)\" title=\"Big Mama (EP)\">Big Mama</a></b></i> from 10 to 15 seconds of music produced each day over two months?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Mama_(EP)","retrieved":1775889381794},{"title":"a 2009 series of missile strikes by the US (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Yemen originally took responsibility for <b><a href=\"/wiki/2009_United_States_missile_strikes_in_Yemen\" title=\"2009 United States missile strikes in Yemen\">a 2009 series of missile strikes by the US</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2009_United_States_missile_strikes_in_Yemen","retrieved":1775889381795},{"title":"a bridge in Ontario (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Waaban_Crossing\" title=\"Waaban Crossing\">a bridge in Ontario</a></b> was named after an <a href=\"/wiki/Ojibwe_language\" title=\"Ojibwe language\">Ojibwe</a> word meaning 'dawn' or 'morning light'?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waaban_Crossing","retrieved":1775889381796},{"title":"Habiburrahman El Shirazy (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the debut novel of <b><a href=\"/wiki/Habiburrahman_El_Shirazy\" title=\"Habiburrahman El Shirazy\">Habiburrahman El Shirazy</a></b> beat out <i>Harry Potter</i> as Indonesia's \"favourite book\" of 2005?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Habiburrahman_El_Shirazy","retrieved":1775889381797},{"title":"New Protection (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Australia's <b><a href=\"/wiki/New_Protection\" title=\"New Protection\">New Protection</a></b> policy made tariff relief for manufacturers contingent on paying employees a living wage?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_Protection","retrieved":1775889381802},{"title":"Gao Cai (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Gao_Cai\" title=\"Gao Cai\">Gao Cai</a></b>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Eunuchs_in_China\" title=\"Eunuchs in China\">Chinese eunuch</a> during the <a href=\"/wiki/Ming_dynasty\" title=\"Ming dynasty\">Ming dynasty</a>, was accused of consuming the brains of young boys in the belief that it would restore his penis?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gao_Cai","retrieved":1775889381802},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\" about=\"#mwt8\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;}